description:
## Problem

Both the initFavicon message handler (line 380) and the entry point (lines 387-390) call init(). If background sends initFavicon while init() is already running (between isInitialized check and isInitialized = true), race condition can occur.

## Location

content.js:378-391

## Fix

Add mutex:
```javascript
let initInProgress = false;

async function init() {
  if (isInitialized || initInProgress) return;
  initInProgress = true;
  try {
    // ... existing code ...
    isInitialized = true;
  } finally {
    initInProgress = false;
  }
}
```

Helper function to convert blob to base64 data URL.

**Implementation:**
```javascript
function blobToDataURL(blob) {
    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
        const reader = new FileReader();
        reader.onloadend = () => resolve(reader.result);
        reader.onerror = reject;
        reader.readAsDataURL(blob);
    });
}
```

**File:** js/background.js

**Verify:** Call with test blob, confirm output starts with 'data:image/png;base64,'

Create composeFavicon(iconDataUrl, showBadge) function using HTML5 Canvas.

**Implementation:**
```javascript
function composeFavicon(iconDataUrl, showBadge) {
    return new Promise((resolve) => {
        const canvas = document.createElement('canvas');
        canvas.width = 32;
        canvas.height = 32;
        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');

        const img = new Image();
        img.onload = () => {
            // Draw workspace icon
            ctx.drawImage(img, 0, 0, 32, 32);

            if (showBadge) {
                // Draw red dot at top-right
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.arc(26, 6, 6, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                ctx.fillStyle = '#E01E5A'; // Slack red
                ctx.fill();
            }

            resolve(canvas.toDataURL('image/png'));
        };
        img.src = iconDataUrl;
    });
}
```

**File:** js/content.js

**Verify:** Test in console with sample base64 image, confirm output is valid PNG data URL.

Add 1px white stroke around red circle for visibility on dark icons.

**Implementation (add after ctx.fill()):**
```javascript
ctx.strokeStyle = 'white';
ctx.lineWidth = 1;
ctx.stroke();
```

**File:** js/content.js (inside composeFavicon)

**Verify:** Test with dark workspace icon, confirm white border visible around red dot.

Fetch workspace icon via background script and pre-compose both favicon variants.

**Implementation:**
```javascript
async function fetchAndCacheIcons(teamIconUrl) {
    // Request background to fetch (CORS bypass)
    const response = await chrome.runtime.sendMessage({
        action: "fetchIcon",
        url: teamIconUrl
    });

    if (!response.success) {
        throw new Error(response.error);
    }

    iconCache.teamIconDataUrl = response.dataUrl;

    // Pre-compose both variants
    iconCache.normalFavicon = await composeFavicon(response.dataUrl, false);
    iconCache.unreadFavicon = await composeFavicon(response.dataUrl, true);
}
```

**File:** js/content.js

**Verify:** Log iconCache after init, confirm all three properties populated with data URLs.

