Update f() function to use cached favicons and respect showDot setting.

**Implementation (replace existing f function):**
```javascript
function f(settings, icons) {
    if (!settings.enable) {
        s(icons.defaultIcon);
        return;
    }

    if (iconCache.normalFavicon) {
        const favicon = (hasUnread && settings.showDot) 
            ? iconCache.unreadFavicon 
            : iconCache.normalFavicon;
        s(favicon);
    } else {
        s(icons.teamIcon);
    }
}
```

